  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Looking at the sky after the war between the three continents and the immortal miracle of Cloud Cover Continent stirs hairy man passions, Black Hair King decides to send an imperial decree. The immortal miracle is an auspicious sign. He will hold a martial competition in remembrance, and the winner may choose a treasure from the treasury.",
      "chapters": [
        1050
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_cloud_cover_continent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When he looks at the sky after the immortal miracle, his eyes shine with brilliant light.",
      "chapters": [
        1050
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At the national martial contest he sits on a raised platform, and his eyes flash with bright lights when a planted scheme activates.",
      "chapters": [
        1084
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The idea is not new; he had thought about it for a long time. The war between the three continents made him realize that treating Gu refinement as important above all needed to be abandoned, and that elite Gu Masters skilled in combat were needed for future battles. With his order, a huge commotion spreads from the imperial city outward.",
      "chapters": [
        1050
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "martial-competition-policy",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the capital of Black Hair Kingdom he watches from a raised platform and frowns at the prospect of a human Gu Master winning the first national martial contest. He has planned beforehand and tampered with the battle. Fang Yuan’s will tells Fang Zheng that a soul path Gu worm in Fang Zheng’s soul has a faint connection with Black Hair King on the platform, so the king is the one who schemed against him.",
      "chapters": [
        1084
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
